step Do, in this order
  zone map 1431
  tip Kicks off the Shadowy Figure chain. · Ends in Wetlands, so it lines up with the next stop. · Skeleton Fingers + Rot Blossoms for the Night Watch and Zombie Juice chains. · Shackle (Shift+X) the 2nd skeleton. · Packed with Lv 27-28 undead. · Shackle (Shift+X) one, kill the other. · Ghoul Ribs + Fangs at the NE mausoleum.
  task "Sven's Camp → The Shadowy Figure" optional
  task "Proving Your Worth → Seeking Wisdom → The Doomed Fleet" optional
  task "Raven Hill skeletons + Rot Blossoms" optional
  task "Crimes Against Anatomy" optional
  task "Ghoulish Effigy → Ogre Thieves" optional
  accept 57 "The Night Watch" @73.5,46.8

step The Night Watch
  zone map 1431
  tip Kill Nightbane Shadow Weavers. · Climb the cliff to skip the long walk.
  complete 57 "The Night Watch" @21.8,47.4
  turnin 57 "The Night Watch" @73.5,46.8

step Stormwind trip
  zone map 1453
  tip 30 = Mind Control, Prayer of Healing, Shadow Protection. · Lv 20+ with 20 books = Greater Friend of the Library (ring: Field Researcher's Loop or Philanthropist's Ring).
  accept 66 "The Legend of Stalvan" npc 265 "Madame Eva" map 1430 @15.2,40.0
  task "Train Lv 28 / 30" optional
  task "Turn in library books" optional

step The Legend of Stalvan
  zone map 1453
  tip Long run-around chain, but big XP. · The Forlorn Spirit spawns at the Stormwind crate, so be ready.
  turnin 66 "The Legend of Stalvan" npc 267 "Clerk Daltry" map 1430 @11.7,41.6

